# JVM crash dumps from the bundled jadx run when it OOMs or
# segfaults — operator-local diagnostic only, never the repo's
# concern. Pattern matches the standard HotSpot hs_err_pid<N>.log
# layout in cwd.
hs_err_pid*.log
